+Share host folders into Android's internal storage.
+
+[waydroid] shared_folders in waydroid.cfg lists "host folder:storage path" pairs, one per
+line (default ~/Downloads:Download/Host, an empty value disables it). Once vold has bound
+/data/media to the FUSE lower path, the container manager bind-mounts each folder below the
+session's data directory with an id mapping between the session user and MediaProvider, and
+the mount reaches Android through propagation. Stopping the container unmounts them.
+
